  "id": "generated-placeholders-expansion-limit",
  "description": "Plan v7 section 8.3 generated-placeholder clause: the cumulative generated-expansion character budget at its default of 1,048,576. Six independent doubling chains of 18 levels each; every distinct placeholder is expanded and billed exactly once (StringInterpolator.placeholderNamesIn returns a set, and interpolateTemplate memoizes by name), so chain level j costs 2^(18-j) characters, one chain costs 262,143 and six cost 1,572,858, while the largest single expansion is 131,072 — half the 262,144-character interpolated-output cap. The cumulative budget is therefore what stops the render, and it trips inside the fifth chain.",
